</a>
    </h2>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Chapter added by Ordinance <a href="https://efiles.portlandoregon.gov/record/14747075">190598</a>, effective December 10, 2021.)</p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-ee41d18fa8911d8c06ab94dbf21edc2eba7421d298d9c6bbd80230df36debe25">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
